# Allowlist approach: ignore everything, then re-include only the static site.
# Wrangler 4.x uploads dotfiles by default, so an explicit allowlist is the
# only safe way to keep .git/, .wrangler/, .claude/ etc. out of public assets.
# The 1955 tile pyramid is served from R2 via tiles.hapmap.app, not bundled.
*
!index.html
